   FIRST_ATTEMPT_DELIVERY_TMSP         TIMESTAMP_TZ(9) COMMENT 'The timestamp when the shipment is delivered by service provider for the first time. It will be considered in customer quota as the service provider has fulfilled its duty. It does not necessarily mean_2 that customer has received shipment as he/she might not have been at home',
   CUST_DELIVERY_ACTUAL_TMSP           TIMESTAMP_TZ(9) COMMENT 'The timestamp when the customer has received delivery physically. It will not affect any DLZ quota, because it is up the customer when to pick up the delivery from neighbour or post office etc.',
