   SECOND_HUB_LOC_DESCR                VARCHAR(100)    COMMENT 'Describes the location_2 of the second Hub of a Carrier/Hauler where the Parcel gets sent to / arrives at. It is the last hub on the way of the parcel delivery to the customer.',
