   PACK_SIZE_TYPE_CD                   VARCHAR(50)     COMMENT 'The code for the package_2 size type  (Normal , Überlänge, XXL , Heavy etc)',
   DELIVERY_TYPE_CD                    VARCHAR(5)      COMMENT 'The code for the package_2 delivery type  (Home Delivery, Shop Delivery, Locker Delivery)',
   IS_PRODUCTSIZE_USED_FG              BOOLEAN         COMMENT 'Discriminator which tells whether trackingId is using Article sizes or is within a Package_2 and therefore the package_2 size',
