   VEHICLE_DEPARTURE_TMSP              TIMESTAMP_TZ(9) COMMENT 'The timestamp when a truck departed from the warehouse',
   VEHICLE_HUB_LOADING_START_TMSP      TIMESTAMP_TZ(9) COMMENT 'The timestamp when a truck with a certain truck plate nr is doing the very first hub scan tmsp for the first package_2 of its entire freight at the warehouse ',
   VEHICLE_HUB_LOADING_END_TMSP        TIMESTAMP_TZ(9) COMMENT 'Based on the first hub scan tmsp ranges the minimum first hub scan tmsp per range is defined as unloading stop tmsp',
   VEHICLE_HUB_LOADING_PCT             NUMERIC(38,5)   COMMENT 'Classification of the first hub scan tmsp in ranges for its entire freight of a truck with a certain truck plate nr. The classification is done in a range of 0, 95, 96, 97, 98, 99, 100 percent ranks starting with the very first hub scan as rank 0.',
   VEHICLE_HUB_LOADING_DUR_HR          NUMERIC(38,5)   COMMENT 'Time difference of the unloading start tmsp and stop tmsp in hours.',
   DELIVERY_POSTPONED_TGT_TMSP         TIMESTAMP_TZ(9) COMMENT 'The timestamp of the postponed target delivery date',
   PACK_HEIGHT_UOM_CD                  VARCHAR(5)      COMMENT ' A code for the unit_2 of measure for package_2 height',
   PACK_WIDTH_UOM_CD                   VARCHAR(5)      COMMENT ' A code for the unit_2 of measure for package_2 width',
   PACK_LENGTH_UOM_CD                  VARCHAR(5)      COMMENT ' A code for the unit_2 of measure for package_2 length',
   PACK_GIRTH_UOM_CD                   VARCHAR(5)      COMMENT ' A code for the unit_2 of measure for package_2 girth',
   PACK_WEIGHT_UOM_CD                  VARCHAR(5)      COMMENT ' A code for the unit_2 of measure for package_2 weight',
   PACK_VOLUME_UOM_CD                  VARCHAR(5)      COMMENT ' A code for the unit_2 of measure for package_2 volume',
   CUST_SHIP_DELAY_DAY                 NUMERIC(38,5)   COMMENT 'If cust_ship_punctuality_cd has the value “too late” then the delay will be calculated in days, not subtracting possible weekend days (Saturday, Sunday) or regional holidays',
   HAULER_DELAY_HR                     NUMERIC(38,5)   COMMENT 'If hauler_punctuality_cd has the value “too late” then the delay will be calculated in hours, subtracting possible weekend days (Saturday, Sunday) or regional holidays',
   WH_DELAY_HR                         NUMERIC(38,5)   COMMENT 'If wh_punctuality_cd has the value “too late” then the delay will be calculated in hours, subtracting possible weekend days (Saturday, Sunday) or regional holidays',
   CUST_SHIP_PUNCTUALITY_CD            VARCHAR(50)     COMMENT 'Calculation of the punctuality of the package_2 to the customer. The punctuality is based on the time difference of the customer delivery target date and the first attempt delivery tmsp. Possible values are punctual (pünktlich), too late (zu spät) or delivery not confirmed (Zustellung nicht bestätigt)',
   HAULER_PUNCTUALITY_CD               VARCHAR(50)     COMMENT 'Calculation of the punctuality of the hauler delivering the package_2 to the customer. The punctuality is based on the time difference of the customer delivery target hauler tmsp and the first attempt delivery tmsp. Possible values are punctual (pünktlich), too late (zu spät), delivery open (Sendung offen) or income scan pending (WE Scan ausstehend)',
   WH_PUNCTUALITY_CD                   VARCHAR(50)     COMMENT 'Calculation of the punctuality of a truck leaving the warehouse. The punctuality is based on the time difference of the warehouse leave target tmsp and the warehouse leave actual tmsp. Possible values are punctual (pünktlich), too late (zu spät) or leave pending (WA ausstehend)',
