   CUST_PAYM_METHOD_CD                 VARCHAR(5)      COMMENT 'Unique code of the payment method',
   IC_ORDER_NR                         VARCHAR(20)     COMMENT 'The order number assigned to the intercompany sale order in the source system',
   IC_ORDER_DT                         DATE            COMMENT 'The date when order was made',
   PACK_ORDER_CREATE_PUNCTUALITY_CD    VARCHAR(10)     COMMENT 'This code denotes the punctuality of the package_2 order creation in EWM (warehouse system) compared to wh_leave_tgt_tmsp or compared to a fixed point in time (2 a.m.) If the package_2 order is created in EWM before 2 a.m. or before wh_leave_tgt_tmsp, the punctuality is considered "on time". Otherwise, it is considered "too late".',
   LOCKER_LOCATED_AT_LIDL_STORE_FG     BOOLEAN         COMMENT 'A flag indicating if locker is situated at Lidl store',
   DWH_CREATED_TMSP                    TIMESTAMP_LTZ(9) NOT NULL COMMENT 'The point in time when this record was created in the data warehouse.',
   DWH_UPDATED_TMSP                    TIMESTAMP_LTZ(9) NOT NULL COMMENT 'The point in time when this record was last updated.',
   DWH_SRC_FILE_NAME                   VARCHAR(255)    COMMENT 'The path and the name of the file(s) from which this record was loaded.',
   SRC_FILE_TMSP                       TIMESTAMP_LTZ(9) NOT NULL COMMENT 'The point in time when this record was extracted from the source.',   
   CONSTRAINT PK_T_FACT_SALES_PACKAGE_SHIPMENT PRIMARY KEY (PACK_SID) NOT ENFORCED 
)  COMMENT = 'Combines the information about the package_2 and the details of its shipment  ( including Lidl Webshops customer orders and IC orders, excluding dropshipments). A detailed facted created to support delivery report (DLZ).
             This table has same granularity and main src as T_FACT_GOODS_PACKAGE_SHIPMENT_2, however here we have a limited subset of the data.
             Only shipments from a LDL warehouse directly to customers (regular or intercompany orders). 
             The table is additionally enriched with information about carrier/hauler and vehicle used for transport and the transportation steps itself.
             At some point it was decided that enriching all data in T_FACT_GOODS_PACKAGE_SHIPMENT_2 will be unnecessary and would require a lot of processing time, so this table was separated and it includes only subset of all package_2 shipments. In the future this decision could be reevaluated.
             
             Main Src - SAP ERP table VEKP, enriched with data from ZEWT_VEH_HEADER , and "Carrier Layer"';
